### Admin request records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests?limit=25&minStatusCode=400
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Request statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Request detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: ordinary users receive 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### Admin API usage (latest 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin API usage with dashboard filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/api-requests/usage?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-08-31T23:59:59.999Z&routeContains=/api/v1/ai&outcome=success&authenticated=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

